Halotrcer websites (www.halotrcer.com, tokvera.halotrcer.com, sievant.halotrcer.com)

This repository ships three third-party fonts, self-hosted as Latin-subset WOFF2 files
in src/assets/fonts/. They are unmodified apart from subsetting and, for Karla, limiting
the weight axis to 400-800. Sources and checksums: docs/fonts.md.

